cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this image in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "terrame-docker: TerraME and LuccME in a Docker image"
abstract: >-
  Docker image of TerraME 2.0.1 with the LuccME 3.1 package, running headless by
  default (Xvfb) or with a graphical interface, to run the same land use change
  models reproducibly on any machine with Docker.
authors:
  - given-names: "Sérgio Souza"
    family-names: "Costa"
    affiliation: "Universidade Federal do Maranhão (UFMA), LambdaGeo Research Group"
version: 0.4.1
date-released: 2026-10-01
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/profsergiocosta/terrame-docker"
url: "https://hub.docker.com/r/profsergiocosta/terrame-luccme"
keywords:
  - TerraME
  - LuccME
  - Docker
  - land use change
  - reproducibility
  - geospatial modeling
